<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>圆盘把手</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>圆盘把手外观</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>0.2.61 起（AevonGripPageV261）：把手的位置和长度搬到了这个独立页面，一级页只留入口。两个滑条都是拖动即时生效，不用注销。把手是贴屏幕右缘的小短竖条（宽 5pt），但可点热区向屏幕内侧延伸约 40pt、上下各多出 14pt —— 手指不必精确按在竖条上。注意：全屏 App 里从把手开始的那根手指会被整根拦下（不再带着 App 内滑动，比如 QQ 的左滑删除），所以把手热区那一小条位置的普通点击也不会进 App。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>位置：从底部起 %</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripY</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>30</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>10</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>90</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>10 = 贴近屏幕底部，90 = 贴近顶部；默认 30（单手最顺手）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>长度：pt</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripLen</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>64</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>36</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>400</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>36 = 很短的一条，400 = 盖住整条右缘（相当于 0.3.7 的「右侧任意高度都能呼」）；默认 64。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发宽度：pt</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripWidth</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>24</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>12</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>60</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>从屏幕右缘向内算。24 = 默认（0.3.7 的体感）；越小越不容易误碰，但越难划中；最小 17（把手自身宽度，再小没有意义）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>右缘整条都能呼（不推荐）</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripScope</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「右缘整条都能呼」关着（推荐）：只有把手那一条带能呼出圆盘，带外的右缘左滑归侧滑返回插件 —— 这就是「不跟左滑返回插件抢手势」。打开：右缘任意高度左滑都呼盘，等于 0.3.7 的行为，会和侧滑返回插件冲突。只有当你发现把手带怎么调都呼不出来时才需要打开。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
